Our changes to NVIDIA/NemoClaw at commit 2cf1ecd69 (Apache-2.0). sandbox.sh applies them with `git apply`; git ignores
this text before the first diff.

`nemoclaw onboard --agent <name>` only accepts agents that its managed-startup code knows. These changes register one
more, `security-triage`, as a one-shot terminal agent with a single inference role and no dashboard or messaging: its
profile and environment mapping, its config generator, its state directory, its use of the host-local inference route,
and the matching fixtures in NemoClaw's tests. The agent itself is the directory security-triage/, which sandbox.sh
copies to agents/security-triage/.

